00:22:35,520 --> 00:22:37,600
safety and security of agents meetings.

273
00:22:37,870 --> 00:22:43,200
And some of these things are about build the connective tissue, have people who wouldn't normally talk to each other because their worlds are a little bit different,

274
00:22:43,280 --> 00:22:48,960
they come from different backgrounds, they're focused on different problems, be forced to interact, be forced to think about shared problems.

275
00:22:49,230 --> 00:22:54,560
And a lot of that shared empathy, that shared understanding, that shared technical context is paying dividends right now.

276
00:22:55,886 --> 00:23:05,520
At the same time, though, the implications of this are that momentum on new models is going to what significantly slow? Do you have a sense of the impact?

