00:23:05,920 --> 00:23:11,440
Well, I would put this differently, because I've always taken this lens to how do you think about progress?

278
00:23:11,662 --> 00:23:13,060
How do you think about progress in this field?

279
00:23:13,550 --> 00:23:17,892
And if you only think about progress as what's your score on a benchmark?

